[en.FOCUS_C18_101_CIVIL_RAILWAY]
Commune Artery

[en.FOCUS_C18_101_CIVIL_RAILWAY_desc]
The role of the Western Railway Line in driving local industrial development has proven the importance of railways. To drive national development, we need a railway network that radiates throughout the Kirin commune.

[zh.FOCUS_C18_101_CIVIL_RAILWAY]
社群动脉

[zh.FOCUS_C18_101_CIVIL_RAILWAY_desc]
西部铁路线对当地工业发展的带动作用已经证明了铁路的重要性，想要带动全国发展，我们需要一个辐射整个麒麟社群的铁路网。

